              "id": "27729545"
            }
          ],
          "value": "A hexamer formed by a trimer of dimers. Interacts with the first 260 residues of CcmM; both the N-terminal 206 residues and the C-terminal tail contribute to CcmM binding (PubMed:27729545). Interacts with full-length and the N-terminal 249 residues of CcmM. A probable CcmM-CcaA-CcmN complex as well as a CcaA-RuBisCO-CcmM complex can also be isolated (PubMed:17993516)"
        }
