          ],
          "value": "Dimerization, activity and interactions with CcmM requires all but the last 60 amino acids of the protein (PubMed:17993516). The C-terminal tail (about 55 residues) inhibits CA activity about 10-fold; it might attenuate activity before encapsulation in the carboxysome (PubMed:27729545)"
